
# BarotraumaVR

OpenXR VR mod for [Barotrauma](https://store.steampowered.com/app/602960/Barotrauma/). The game keeps its 2D camera and round logic. The headset gets a separate stereo picture with depth, controllers, and a first-person room view.

**Status:** 0.1.0-alpha for Barotrauma **1.13.4.0** (Windows). Expect bugs.

Steam Workshop: *(вставь ссылку после публикации)*  
Author: [Naduvaha](https://github.com/Naduvaha)

